# Template for apps/web/.dev.vars — copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local dev.
# These override wrangler.jsonc `vars` during `vite dev` so the Worker talks to a
# local API instead of production. See CLAUDE.md → "Local development".

# Local Railway API from `bun run dev:api`.
API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# Optional: to exercise the real proxy gate, add a PROXY_SECRET line here whose
# value matches the API's PROXY_SECRET env var. Leave it out and the API's gate
# stays a no-op, which is all local preview needs.
